<title>OMAN: Oman Seeb airport handles 3,604 tonnes in July.</title>
<headline>Oman Seeb airport handles 3,604 tonnes in July.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Seeb International Airport handled almost 3,604 tonnes of cargo in July, down from the 3,764 tonnes recorded in June.</p>
<p>Airport figures show that most freight handled by the airport on the outskirts of the capital Muscat was incoming.</p>
<p>Imports made up 2,224 tonnes, while exports totalled 1,379 tonnes in the month. The figures do not include mail.</p>
<p>The busiest month so far this year was March, when Seeb handled nearly 4,190 tonnes of cargo. - Dubai newsroom +9714 - 626990 - www.racs.comm</p>
